flowchart TD
    OCC["Hourly OCC conflict counts, the Chapter 13 signal"] --> OCCD["OccRetryDriftDetector, z-score 3.0 plus absolute threshold 25"]
    SIM["Rolling mean top-5 retrieval similarity"] --> SIMD["SimilarityDriftDetector, baseline band 0.78 to 0.84"]
    STORE["MetricsStore: offline JSONL by default, opt-in Opik project day2-agentic-cicd"] --> OCC
    STORE --> SIM
    OCCD -- "retry rate above the rolling baseline" --> ALERT["Drift alert with window and reason"]
    SIMD -- "similarity below the band floor" --> ALERT
    ALERT --> EXITS["detect_drift.py exits nonzero and names the drifted windows"]
    ALERT --> PROM["Optional Prometheus export, telemetry extra"]
